=== DISCLAIMER (Financial Research Use) ===

This repository contains code and analysis for financial machine learning
research on EUR/USD directional prediction. The results shown (backtested
Sharpe ratios, returns, per-fold performance) are from historical data with
idealized transaction cost assumptions. Past backtest performance does NOT
guarantee future results. Foreign exchange markets carry substantial risk of
loss. Do not use this code for live trading without:
  1. Independent replication of results
  2. Rigorous out-of-sample validation on unseen data
  3. Realistic transaction cost, slippage, and spread modeling
  4. Risk management (position limits, stop-losses, drawdown caps)
  5. Consultation with a qualified financial professional

The authors accept no liability for financial losses resulting from use of
this software. See also the "Known Limitations & Risks" section of the
Medium article in autoresearch/autoresearch_results/medium_article.md.
